Package: xpar
Title: Cross-Species Parentage Assignment for Interspecific Hybrids
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Nelson", , , "carrenekwang@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Self-calibrated Mendelian trio-consistency testing for
    parentage assignment in interspecific and hybridizing systems, where
    the true genotyping/discordance error rate is estimated empirically
    from the data rather than assumed fixed. Includes a joint two-parent
    trio test, block bootstrap over linkage groups for valid uncertainty
    quantification under linkage disequilibrium, and candidate-pair
    ranking by win probability.
